{"id":"bdad1cac-eb85-4be3-be21-ee1bc1b48ecf","rule_id":"custom-win-special-privileges","name":"【自定义】Windows特殊特权登录","immutable":false,"rule_source":{"type":"internal"},"version":1,"revision":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:40.724Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T02:33:45.337Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-70m","to":"now","description":"检测 Windows 安全事件 4672：使用特殊特权登录。对应需求：特权审计补充。","tags":["主题: 身份安全","操作系统: Windows","来源: 自定义","对应需求: 特权审计"],"author":["sec-siem-demo"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","winlog.computer_name","user.name","user.id","source.ip","event.code","winlog.event_id","event.action","event.outcome","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName","winlog.event_data.MemberName","message","event.original"]},"related_integrations":[],"required_fields":[],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. Windows/域控需采集安全日志（Winlogbeat 或 Elastic Agent Windows 集成）。\n2. 关键事件：4624/4625/4672/4720/4722-4726/4738/4728/4732/4756/4740/4741/5136-5141 等。\n3. 告警请优先看突出显示字段中的用户、源IP、主机、事件ID。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n特权登录较常见；与异常时间/异常源 IP 联用更有价值。\n\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 核对是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚/禁用账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 关联同用户/同源 IP 的登录失败与特权组变更。\n","false_positives":["变更窗口内的合法身份管理操作"],"references":["https://www.ultimatewindowssecurity.com/securitylog/encyclopedia/"],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"query","language":"kuery","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.security-*","logs-*"],"query":"event.code:4672 or winlog.event_id:4672","alert_suppression":{"group_by":["host.name","user.name"],"duration":{"value":120,"unit":"m"},"missing_fields_strategy":"suppress"}}
